---
title: "obligation debt lifecycle (Current Finance: Obligation)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_exists: debts.contains(coin_type)?

    q_check_exists --> q_first_borrow: no existing debt
    q_first_borrow --> q_check_not_collateral: assert coin_type not in ctokens
    q_check_not_collateral --> q_init_debt: debt = new(amount, borrow_index)
    q_init_debt --> q_return_amount: return amount as total_borrow
    q_return_amount --> [*]

    q_check_exists --> q_accrue: existing debt
    q_accrue --> q_calc_new_debt: new_debt = old_debt * (new_index / old_index)
    q_calc_new_debt --> q_increase: debt.unsafe_increase(amount)
    q_increase --> q_return_total: return total_borrow
    q_return_total --> [*]

    q_return_total --> q_repay: repay_debt path
    q_repay --> q_accrue_repay: accrue_interest(borrow_index)
    q_accrue_repay --> q_check_full: debt_ceil lte repay_amount?
    q_check_full --> q_clear: debt.cleared() -- zero out
    q_check_full --> q_partial: debt.unsafe_decrease(repay_amount)
    q_clear --> q_check_remove: !debt.has_debt?
    q_partial --> q_check_remove
    q_check_remove --> q_remove: wit_table.remove(debt)
    q_check_remove --> q_keep: keep debt entry
    q_remove --> [*]
    q_keep --> [*]

    note right of q_calc_new_debt
        INV-001: debt accrues interest via borrow_index ratio
        INV-002: Cannot borrow asset already deposited as collateral
        INV-003: Cannot deposit asset already borrowed as debt
        INV-004: Full repay clears debt and removes entry from table
        INV-005: Partial repay uses ceil() which may slightly overpay
    end note
